# Two kinds of boxes:
#   make a box   = a kept box. Boxy cleans it up at the end.
#   borrow a box = a borrowed box. YOU must return it when you're done.

make a box called age
put 7 in age
say "age is ", age

borrow a box called score
put 100 in score
say "score is ", score

# Always return the boxes you borrow.
return score

# Comment out the next line and run the program again.
# Boxy will tell you, by name and line number, that you forgot.
# borrow a box called forgotten
